Open the workbench with the link from `axocoatl url --config CONFIG`, where CONFIG is the configuration the service was installed with.

Note: this is the Always-On *Service* (keeps the daemon process alive).
Proactive Agents — agents that act on their own — are managed as Automations in Settings.
